    "❯ 已附加课程上下文（skill · 文稿 · 重点）。输入任务并运行。\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "❯ Course context attached (skill · transcript · key points). Enter a task and run.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「这一讲最重要的是反向传播：先沿计算图把梯度传回来，再更新参数，这两个步骤不要混。」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“The key idea in this lecture is backpropagation: send the gradients back through the graph first, then update the parameters. Don't mix up the two steps.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个课程": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One course"
          }
        }
      }
    },
